  <!-- Link: never link d3d11.lib, an import of d3d11.dll would resolve to this module itself.
       openvr_api.dll is delay-loaded: the mod loads its own copy from <game>\VR\ (the game ships an older one).
       Post-build: copies d3d11.dll into the game's bin\win64, so the game must not be running. -->
